    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Trie + DFS on wildcards</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/design-add-and-search-words-data-structure/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 211</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Design Add and Search Words Data Structure</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Store the words in a trie. A letter in the pattern follows exactly one edge; a <code>.</code> must try every child, so search is a DFS that stops at the first success. add is O(L); search is O(L) without dots and at most O(26<sup>2</sup>·L) with the two dots allowed here.</p>\n"
